{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# AVD Health Dashboard 2.0\r\nGuided Azure Virtual Desktop troubleshooting across seven categories: telemetry coverage; fleet and host-pool health; complaint-time user impact; logon, agent, and graphics; client and protocol; errors and session evidence; and operational changes.\r\n\r\nStart with coverage and the host-pool matrix. Continue only into the category named by its **Recommended next action**. The workbook correlates AVD evidence; it does not directly measure application transaction time."
      },
      "name": "AVD Health Dashboard 2.0 heading",
      "styleSettings": {
        "margin": "0",
        "padding": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "8d289b64-c63c-4a69-9e74-45ee6c6b3560",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Workspace",
            "label": "Log Analytics workspace",
            "type": 5,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "value": [
              "value::1"
            ],
            "typeSettings": {
              "resourceTypeFilter": {
                "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces": true
              },
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::1"
              ],
              "showDefault": false
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "a6d078d9-816c-4a52-8d02-80f62484c247",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "label": "Time range",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 604800000
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 3600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 43200000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 172800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 259200000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 1209600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills"
      },
      "name": "Dashboard parameters",
      "styleSettings": {
        "margin": "0",
        "padding": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "ba9650db-5ac0-47a0-a094-72992eb3ec10",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "HostPoolFilter",
            "label": "Host pool",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "union (print value=\"All\",label=\"All host pools\"),(union (WVDConnections | where TimeGenerated {TimeRange} | project value=extract(\"/hostpools/([^/]+)\",1,_ResourceId)),(WVDAgentHealthStatus | where TimeGenerated > ago(90d) | project value=extract(\"/hostpools/([^/]+)\",1,_ResourceId)) | extend value=iff(isempty(value),\"Unknown\",value) | distinct value | project value,label=value) | order by label asc",
            "value": [
              "All"
            ],
            "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
          },
          {
            "id": "195849cd-32f5-4a82-8f72-2980467637d6",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "GatewayFilter",
            "label": "Gateway region",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "union (print value=\"All\",label=\"All gateway regions\"),(WVDConnections | where TimeGenerated {TimeRange} | extend value=iff(isempty(GatewayRegion),\"Unknown\",GatewayRegion) | distinct value | project value,label=value) | order by label asc",
            "value": [
              "All"
            ],
            "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
          },
          {
            "id": "b3ce66f4-ac77-40f0-b98d-d99a6959e65b",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "UserFilter",
            "label": "Search or select user",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "union (print value=\"All\",label=\"All users\"),(WVDConnections | where TimeGenerated {TimeRange} | extend value=iff(isempty(UserName),\"Unknown\",UserName) | distinct value | project value,label=value) | order by label asc",
            "value": [
              "All"
            ],
            "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
          },
          {
            "id": "d6553461-56cb-4286-85fd-94c29c86f2cc",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TransportFilter",
            "label": "Transport outcome",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "datatable(value:string,label:string)[\"All\",\"All transport outcomes\",\"UDP direct\",\"UDP direct\",\"UDP via TURN\",\"UDP via TURN\",\"TCP fallback\",\"TCP fallback\",\"Unknown\",\"Unknown\"]",
            "value": [
              "All"
            ],
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
          },
          {
            "id": "682d531f-070b-4a7e-98ef-42ad90270030",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "UnusedDays",
            "label": "Unused host threshold",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": false,
            "quote": "'",
            "query": "datatable(value:string,label:string)[\"14\",\"14 days - aggressive pooled review\",\"20\",\"20 days\",\"30\",\"30 days - recommended default\",\"45\",\"45 days - personal or seasonal\",\"60\",\"60 days - extended review\"]",
            "value": "30",
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills"
      },
      "name": "Investigation filters",
      "styleSettings": {
        "margin": "0",
        "padding": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## Status and confidence legend\r\n- **Red:** high risk, unhealthy state, or critically low evidence coverage.\r\n- **Orange:** warning threshold or partial evidence that needs validation.\r\n- **Green:** a measured numeric value is inside its configured operating band; required denominator data exists.\r\n- **Blue:** neutral scope or topology context, including supported TURN relay transport.\r\n- **Gray:** unavailable, undefined, or unrecognized evidence. Never interpret gray as healthy.\r\n\r\nCapacity bands: CPU P95 warning/high at 70%/85%; memory-used P95 at 80%/90%. Network bands: RTT P95 at 120/250 ms and bandwidth P10 at 10/5 Mbps. These are dashboard triage bands, not Microsoft service-level objectives; tune them against workload baselines."
      },
      "name": "Risk color legend",
      "styleSettings": {
        "margin": "0",
        "padding": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## Help desk quick start\r\n1. Set the **workspace**, **time range**, and affected **user** or **host pool**.\r\n2. Check **Diagnostic coverage**. Gray or red coverage means evidence is missing; do not call the environment healthy.\r\n3. Open **Fleet health**, then the **Host-pool decision matrix**. Read **Status**, **Finding**, and **Next action** from left to right.\r\n4. Follow only the category named by **Next action**. Compare the same user and time before escalating.\r\n5. Open **Session correlation details**, copy the Correlation ID, and record it with the filters, affected user/host, timestamp, and first abnormal metric.\r\n\r\n**Plain-language terms:** P95 is the value at or below which 95% of observations fall; P10 bandwidth is the value at or below which 10% fall. Coverage is the share of expected hosts or sessions with telemetry. Shortpath is direct UDP. TURN is supported relayed UDP. TCP fallback is supported AVD reverse-connect over TCP/TLS 443 when UDP Shortpath was not established or not reported. It is not automatically a fault; investigate when its share rises or RTT/bandwidth is worse than UDP. FSLogix stores the user profile in a container. Gray means unknown, not good."
      },
      "name": "How to read this dashboard",
      "styleSettings": {
        "margin": "0",
        "padding": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let Expected=datatable(DataSource:string,Purpose:string)[\"WVDConnections\",\"Session identity, state, client, host pool, gateway, and transport\",\"WVDMultiLinkAdd\",\"Shortpath, TURN, and WebSocket link evidence\",\"WVDConnectionNetworkData\",\"In-session AVD RTT and estimated bandwidth\",\"WVDErrors\",\"AVD service, client, connection, and environment errors\",\"WVDCheckpoints\",\"LogonDelay phase timing including profile and FSLogix\",\"WVDAgentHealthStatus\",\"Session-host agent health checks\",\"WVDConnectionGraphicsDataPreview\",\"Graphics encoding, decoding, rendering, and skipped frames\",\"WVDHostRegistrations\",\"Session-host registration activity\",\"WVDManagement\",\"AVD management operations and resource changes\",\"WVDSessionHostManagement\",\"Session-host provisioning and update activity\",\"Perf\",\"Session-host CPU and memory performance counters\"];\r\nlet Observed=union isfuzzy=true (datatable(DataSource:string,TimeGenerated:datetime)[]),(WVDConnections|where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}|project DataSource=\"WVDConnections\",TimeGenerated),(WVDMultiLinkAdd|where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}|project DataSource=\"WVDMultiLinkAdd\",TimeGenerated),(WVDConnectionNetworkData|where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}|project DataSource=\"WVDConnectionNetworkData\",TimeGenerated),(WVDErrors|where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}|project DataSource=\"WVDErrors\",TimeGenerated),(WVDCheckpoints|where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}|project DataSource=\"WVDCheckpoints\",TimeGenerated),(WVDAgentHealthStatus|where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}|project DataSource=\"WVDAgentHealthStatus\",TimeGenerated),(WVDConnectionGraphicsDataPreview|where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}|project DataSource=\"WVDConnectionGraphicsDataPreview\",TimeGenerated),(WVDHostRegistrations|where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}|project DataSource=\"WVDHostRegistrations\",TimeGenerated),(WVDManagement|where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}|project DataSource=\"WVDManagement\",TimeGenerated),(WVDSessionHostManagement|where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}|project DataSource=\"WVDSessionHostManagement\",TimeGenerated),(Perf|where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}|project DataSource=\"Perf\",TimeGenerated)|where isnotempty(DataSource)|summarize Rows=count(),LatestRecord=max(TimeGenerated) by DataSource;\r\nExpected|join kind=leftouter Observed on DataSource|extend Rows=coalesce(Rows,long(0)),Status=case(Rows==0,\"Missing or no rows in range\",LatestRecord < ago(1d),\"Present but stale\",\"Present\")|project Status,DataSource,Purpose,Rows,LatestRecord|order by Status asc,DataSource asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Diagnostic coverage and data freshness",
        "description": "Shows whether each required data source has records in the selected workspace and time range. This panel intentionally ignores the user filter because it validates workspace-level diagnostic collection. Missing data is an investigation gap, not a healthy result.",
        "noDataMessage": "No data was found. Check the selected workspace, time range, and collection prerequisites.",
        "showAnalytics": true,
        "showRefreshButton": true,
        "showExportToExcel": true,
        "exportToExcelOptions": "visible",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "Status",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "colors",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Missing or no rows in range",
                    "representation": "redBright",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Present but stale",
                    "representation": "orange",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Present",
                    "representation": "green",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "thresholdValue": null,
                    "representation": "gray",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "customWidth": "100",
      "name": "Diagnostic coverage readiness",
      "styleSettings": {
        "margin": "0",
        "padding": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 1. Fleet, host pool, and session-host health\r\n**Start:** Fleet health, then the host-pool decision matrix. **Read:** Status, Finding, and Next action before the numbers. **Next:** Open the session-host table only for the affected pool; use the CPU/memory trend to match the complaint time.\nFor a user-facing incident, finish in **Session correlation details** and copy the matching Correlation ID."
      },
      "name": "Host pool capacity section",
      "styleSettings": {
        "margin": "0",
        "padding": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let HostScope=materialize(WVDConnections\r\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\r\n| extend HostPool=extract(\"/hostpools/([^/]+)\",1,_ResourceId),Gateway=iff(isempty(GatewayRegion),\"Unknown\",GatewayRegion),User=iff(isempty(UserName),\"Unknown\",UserName),SessionHost=tostring(SessionHostName)\r\n| extend HostPool=iff(isempty(HostPool),\"Unknown\",HostPool)\r\n| where ('All' in ({HostPoolFilter}) or HostPool in ({HostPoolFilter})) and ('All' in ({GatewayFilter}) or Gateway in ({GatewayFilter})) and ('All' in ({UserFilter}) or User in ({UserFilter}))\r\n| where isnotempty(SessionHost)\r\n| extend HostKey=tolower(tostring(split(SessionHost,\".\")[0]))\r\n| project CorrelationId,TimeGenerated,HostPool,SessionHost,HostKey,User);let HostMap=HostScope | summarize SessionHost=any(SessionHost) by HostKey;\r\nlet CpuPerf=Perf\r\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange} and isnotempty(Computer)\r\n| where CounterName =~ \"% Processor Time\" and InstanceName =~ \"_Total\"\r\n| extend HostKey=tolower(tostring(split(Computer,\".\")[0]))\r\n| join kind=inner HostMap on HostKey\r\n| summarize CpuSamples=count(),CpuP95=percentile(CounterValue,95) by HostKey;\r\nlet MemoryPerf=Perf\r\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange} and isnotempty(Computer)\r\n| where CounterName in~ (\"% Committed Bytes In Use\",\"% Used Memory\")\r\n| extend HostKey=tolower(tostring(split(Computer,\".\")[0]))\r\n| join kind=inner HostMap on HostKey\r\n| summarize MemorySamples=count(),MemoryUsedP95=percentile(CounterValue,95) by HostKey;\r\nlet Health=WVDAgentHealthStatus\r\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange} and isnotempty(SessionHostName)\r\n| extend HostKey=tolower(tostring(split(SessionHostName,\".\")[0]))\r\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated,*) by HostKey\r\n| extend HealthStatus=tostring(column_ifexists(\"Status\",column_ifexists(\"EndpointState\",\"Unknown\")))\r\n| project HostKey,HealthStatus,LatestActiveSessions=toint(ActiveSessions);\r\nlet HostSignals=HostMap\r\n| join kind=leftouter CpuPerf on HostKey\r\n| join kind=leftouter MemoryPerf on HostKey\r\n| join kind=leftouter Health on HostKey;\r\nlet ScopeSummary=HostScope | summarize Hosts=dcount(SessionHost),UsersInRange=dcountif(User,User != \"Unknown\");\r\nlet SignalSummary=HostSignals | summarize CpuHosts=countif(CpuSamples>0),MemoryHosts=countif(MemorySamples>0),HighestCpuP95=round(max(CpuP95),1),HighestMemoryP95=round(max(MemoryUsedP95),1),LatestActiveSessions=sum(coalesce(LatestActiveSessions,0)),LowConfidenceHosts=countif(coalesce(CpuSamples,0)<20 or coalesce(MemorySamples,0)<20),HostsAtHighRisk=countif(CpuP95>=85 or MemoryUsedP95>=90 or HealthStatus in~ (\"Unhealthy\",\"Unavailable\")),HostsNeedingReview=countif(CpuP95>=70 or MemoryUsedP95>=80 or HealthStatus in~ (\"Unhealthy\",\"Unavailable\") or coalesce(CpuSamples,0)<20 or coalesce(MemorySamples,0)<20);\r\nlet Summary=ScopeSummary\r\n| extend JoinKey=1\r\n| join kind=leftouter (SignalSummary | extend JoinKey=1) on JoinKey\r\n| extend CounterCoveragePct=iff(Hosts==0,real(null),round(100.0*min_of(CpuHosts,MemoryHosts)/Hosts,1));\r\nlet SessionHosts=Summary | project Sort=1,Metric=\"Session hosts\",Value=todouble(Hosts),Description=\"Hosts used in the selected scope\",Status=\"Scope\";\r\nlet Users=Summary | project Sort=2,Metric=\"Unique users (selected range)\",Value=todouble(UsersInRange),Description=\"Users seen at any time in the selected range\",Status=\"Scope\";\r\nlet Active=Summary | project Sort=3,Metric=\"Active sessions (latest)\",Value=todouble(LatestActiveSessions),Description=\"Point-in-time total from each host's latest report\",Status=\"Scope\";\r\nlet Coverage=Summary | project Sort=4,Metric=\"CPU + memory counter coverage (%)\",Value=CounterCoveragePct,Description=\"Lower of CPU or memory host coverage\",Status=case(CounterCoveragePct==0,\"Unknown\",CounterCoveragePct<80,\"Warning\",\"Coverage\");\r\nlet Cpu=Summary | project Sort=5,Metric=\"Highest host CPU P95 (%)\",Value=HighestCpuP95,Description=\"Warning 70%; high 85%\",Status=case(isnull(HighestCpuP95),\"Unknown\",HighestCpuP95>=85,\"High\",HighestCpuP95>=70,\"Warning\",\"Healthy\");\r\nlet Memory=Summary | project Sort=6,Metric=\"Highest host memory P95 (%)\",Value=HighestMemoryP95,Description=\"Warning 80%; high 90%\",Status=case(isnull(HighestMemoryP95),\"Unknown\",HighestMemoryP95>=90,\"High\",HighestMemoryP95>=80,\"Warning\",\"Healthy\");\r\nlet Confidence=Summary | project Sort=7,Metric=\"Hosts with low-confidence data\",Value=todouble(LowConfidenceHosts),Description=\"Missing or fewer than 20 CPU/memory samples\",Status=iff(LowConfidenceHosts>0,\"Warning\",\"Healthy\");\nlet Review=Summary | project Sort=8,Metric=\"Hosts needing review\",Value=todouble(HostsNeedingReview),Description=\"Warning/high capacity, unhealthy state, or weak evidence\",Status=case(HostsAtHighRisk>0,\"High\",HostsNeedingReview>0,\"Warning\",\"Healthy\");\r\nunion SessionHosts,Users,Active,Coverage,Cpu,Memory,Confidence,Review\r\n| order by Sort asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "AVD fleet health at a glance",
        "description": "Fleet scope, point-in-time active sessions, range-based unique users, CPU/memory evidence quality, tail utilization, and hosts needing review. Low-confidence means a host is missing a required counter or has fewer than 20 samples; use the host-pool matrix to identify the cause.",
        "noDataMessage": "No fleet data matched. Clear filters; if still empty, check WVDConnections, WVDAgentHealthStatus, and Perf in Diagnostic coverage.",
        "showAnalytics": true,
        "showRefreshButton": true,
        "showExportToExcel": true,
        "exportToExcelOptions": "visible",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "visualization": "tiles",
        "tileSettings": {
          "showBorder": true,
          "titleContent": {
            "columnMatch": "Metric",
            "formatter": 1
          },
          "subtitleContent": {
            "columnMatch": "Description",
            "formatter": 1
          },
          "leftContent": {
            "columnMatch": "Value",
            "formatter": 12,
            "formatOptions": {
              "palette": "auto"
            }
          },
          "secondaryContent": {
            "columnMatch": "Status",
            "formatter": 18,
            "formatOptions": {
              "thresholdsOptions": "colors",
              "thresholdsGrid": [
                {
                  "operator": "==",
                  "thresholdValue": "Scope",
                  "representation": "blue",
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                },
                {
                  "operator": "==",
                  "thresholdValue": "Coverage",
                  "representation": "blue",
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                },
                {
                  "operator": "==",
                  "thresholdValue": "Healthy",
                  "representation": "green",
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                },
                {
                  "operator": "==",
                  "thresholdValue": "Warning",
                  "representation": "orange",
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                },
                {
                  "operator": "==",
                  "thresholdValue": "High",
                  "representation": "redBright",
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                },
                {
                  "operator": "Default",
                  "thresholdValue": null,
                  "representation": "gray",
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "customWidth": "100",
      "name": "AVD health and capacity summary",
      "styleSettings": {
        "margin": "0",
        "padding": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let HostScope=materialize(WVDConnections\r\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\r\n| extend HostPool=extract(\"/hostpools/([^/]+)\",1,_ResourceId),Gateway=iff(isempty(GatewayRegion),\"Unknown\",GatewayRegion),User=iff(isempty(UserName),\"Unknown\",UserName),SessionHost=tostring(SessionHostName)\r\n| extend HostPool=iff(isempty(HostPool),\"Unknown\",HostPool)\r\n| where ('All' in ({HostPoolFilter}) or HostPool in ({HostPoolFilter})) and ('All' in ({GatewayFilter}) or Gateway in ({GatewayFilter})) and ('All' in ({UserFilter}) or User in ({UserFilter}))\r\n| where isnotempty(SessionHost)\r\n| extend HostKey=tolower(tostring(split(SessionHost,\".\")[0]))\r\n| project CorrelationId,TimeGenerated,HostPool,SessionHost,HostKey,User);let HostMap=HostScope | summarize SessionHost=any(SessionHost),HostPool=any(HostPool),UsersInRange=dcountif(User,User != \"Unknown\") by HostKey;\r\nlet PoolBase=HostScope | summarize SessionHosts=dcount(SessionHost),UsersInRange=dcountif(User,User != \"Unknown\"),SessionRecords=dcount(CorrelationId) by HostPool;\r\nlet CpuPerf=Perf\r\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange} and isnotempty(Computer)\r\n| where CounterName =~ \"% Processor Time\" and InstanceName =~ \"_Total\"\r\n| extend HostKey=tolower(tostring(split(Computer,\".\")[0]))\r\n| join kind=inner HostMap on HostKey\r\n| summarize CpuSamples=count(),CpuP95=percentile(CounterValue,95),CpuLatest=max(TimeGenerated) by HostKey,HostPool;\r\nlet MemoryPerf=Perf\r\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange} and isnotempty(Computer)\r\n| where CounterName in~ (\"% Committed Bytes In Use\",\"% Used Memory\")\r\n| extend HostKey=tolower(tostring(split(Computer,\".\")[0]))\r\n| join kind=inner HostMap on HostKey\r\n| summarize MemorySamples=count(),MemoryP95=percentile(CounterValue,95),MemoryLatest=max(TimeGenerated) by HostKey,HostPool;\r\nlet Health=WVDAgentHealthStatus\r\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange} and isnotempty(SessionHostName)\r\n| extend HostKey=tolower(tostring(split(SessionHostName,\".\")[0]))\r\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated,*) by HostKey\r\n| extend HealthStatus=tostring(column_ifexists(\"Status\",column_ifexists(\"EndpointState\",\"Unknown\")))\r\n| project HostKey,LatestActiveSessions=toint(ActiveSessions),HealthStatus;\r\nlet HostSignals=HostMap\r\n| join kind=leftouter CpuPerf on HostKey,HostPool\r\n| join kind=leftouter MemoryPerf on HostKey,HostPool\r\n| join kind=leftouter Health on HostKey;\r\nlet PoolHostSignals=HostSignals\r\n| summarize CpuHosts=countif(CpuSamples>0),MemoryHosts=countif(MemorySamples>0),HighestHostCpuP95Pct=round(max(CpuP95),1),HighestHostMemoryP95Pct=round(max(MemoryP95),1),LatestActiveSessions=sum(coalesce(LatestActiveSessions,0)),UnhealthyHosts=countif(HealthStatus in~ (\"Unhealthy\",\"Unavailable\")) by HostPool;\r\nlet Network=WVDConnectionNetworkData\r\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\r\n| join kind=inner (HostScope | project CorrelationId,HostPool) on CorrelationId\r\n| summarize NetworkSessions=dcount(CorrelationId),NetworkSamples=count(),P95RTTms=round(percentile(EstRoundTripTimeInMs,95),1),P10BandwidthMbps=round(percentile(EstAvailableBandwidthKBps,10)*8.0/1000,2) by HostPool;\r\nPoolBase\r\n| join kind=leftouter PoolHostSignals on HostPool\r\n| join kind=leftouter Network on HostPool\r\n| extend CpuHosts=coalesce(CpuHosts,long(0)),MemoryHosts=coalesce(MemoryHosts,long(0)),LatestActiveSessions=coalesce(LatestActiveSessions,0),UnhealthyHosts=coalesce(UnhealthyHosts,long(0)),NetworkSessions=coalesce(NetworkSessions,long(0)),NetworkSamples=coalesce(NetworkSamples,long(0))\r\n| extend CpuCoveragePct=iff(SessionHosts==0,real(null),round(100.0*CpuHosts/SessionHosts,1)),MemoryCoveragePct=iff(SessionHosts==0,real(null),round(100.0*MemoryHosts/SessionHosts,1)),NetworkCoveragePct=iff(SessionRecords==0,real(null),round(100.0*NetworkSessions/SessionRecords,1)),ActiveSessionsPerHost=round(1.0*LatestActiveSessions/iff(SessionHosts==0,1,SessionHosts),1)\r\n| extend CounterCoveragePct=iff(CpuCoveragePct<MemoryCoveragePct,CpuCoveragePct,MemoryCoveragePct)\r\n| extend Status=case(HighestHostCpuP95Pct>=85 or HighestHostMemoryP95Pct>=90 or P95RTTms>250 or P10BandwidthMbps<5 or UnhealthyHosts>0,\"High\",CounterCoveragePct==0 and NetworkCoveragePct==0,\"Unknown\",HighestHostCpuP95Pct>=70 or HighestHostMemoryP95Pct>=80 or P95RTTms>120 or P10BandwidthMbps<10 or CounterCoveragePct<80 or NetworkCoveragePct<50,\"Warning\",\"Healthy\"),StatusSort=case(HighestHostCpuP95Pct>=85 or HighestHostMemoryP95Pct>=90 or P95RTTms>250 or P10BandwidthMbps<5 or UnhealthyHosts>0,1,HighestHostCpuP95Pct>=70 or HighestHostMemoryP95Pct>=80 or P95RTTms>120 or P10BandwidthMbps<10 or CounterCoveragePct<80 or NetworkCoveragePct<50,2,CounterCoveragePct==0 and NetworkCoveragePct==0,4,3)\r\n| extend Finding=case(UnhealthyHosts>0,\"Unhealthy session host detected\",HighestHostCpuP95Pct>=85 and HighestHostMemoryP95Pct>=90,\"CPU and memory pressure\",HighestHostCpuP95Pct>=85,\"CPU pressure\",HighestHostMemoryP95Pct>=90,\"Memory pressure\",NetworkCoveragePct>=50 and P95RTTms>250,\"High AVD round-trip time\",NetworkCoveragePct>=50 and P10BandwidthMbps<5,\"Constrained AVD bandwidth\",CounterCoveragePct==0,\"CPU or memory counters missing\",CounterCoveragePct<80,\"Partial performance-counter coverage\",NetworkCoveragePct<50,\"Insufficient network coverage\",HighestHostCpuP95Pct>=70 or HighestHostMemoryP95Pct>=80,\"Capacity warning threshold reached\",P95RTTms>120 or P10BandwidthMbps<10,\"Network warning threshold reached\",\"No monitored threshold exceeded\")\r\n| extend NextAction=case(UnhealthyHosts>0,\"Review failed AVD health checks\",HighestHostCpuP95Pct>=70 or HighestHostMemoryP95Pct>=80,\"Open session-host details and compare density\",NetworkCoveragePct>=50 and (P95RTTms>120 or P10BandwidthMbps<10),\"Open complaint-time network and transport panels\",CounterCoveragePct<80,\"Repair AMA performance-counter collection\",NetworkCoveragePct<50,\"Repair network telemetry before judging the path\",\"Correlate the same user and complaint time\")\r\n| project Status,HostPool,Finding,NextAction,SessionHosts,LatestActiveSessions,ActiveSessionsPerHost,UsersInRange,HighestHostCpuP95Pct,HighestHostMemoryP95Pct,CounterCoveragePct,P95RTTms,P10BandwidthMbps,NetworkCoveragePct,UnhealthyHosts,StatusSort\r\n| order by StatusSort asc,HighestHostCpuP95Pct desc\r\n| project-away StatusSort",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Host-pool health decision matrix",
        "description": "Canonical host-pool comparison across capacity, telemetry confidence, latest active sessions, AVD network quality, and agent health. Follow Finding and Next action before opening detailed panels.",
